      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【比赛战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-06/match1944223date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">时隔20年再进决赛！阿森纳1-0马竞总比分2-1晋级 萨卡制胜</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260506/zhanbao_image_1944223_1778013291_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260506/zhanbao_image_1944223_1778013291_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260506/zhanbao_image_1944223_1778013291_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>冲击首个欧冠冠军！阿森纳队史第二次晋级欧冠决赛，上次晋级欧冠决赛还是05/06赛季。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-06/match1921436date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">无缘开门红！U17国足0-1印尼U17 孔玺诺抽射造险国足下场对阵日本</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.71" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260506/202605060314502838_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.71" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.71" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260506/202605060314502838_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260506/202605060314502838_1280.jpg"> </div><p>U17亚洲杯中国队首战告负，第87分钟遭绝杀；下轮U17男足将战日本。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-06/match1968654date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">下轮将战中国队！日本3-1逆转卡塔尔，取U17亚洲杯开门红</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260506/202605060203018060_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260506/202605060203018060_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260506/202605060203018060_1280.jpg"> </div><p>U17亚洲杯B组首轮，日本对阵卡塔尔，日本3-1取胜拿下开门红。下轮比赛，中国队将与日本队展开对决，比赛时间为北京时间5月10日0点。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-06/match1784631date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">距胜利2分！新月2-1逆转赛哈特海湾4连胜 米林破门罗伯乔失误送礼</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260506/zhanbao_image_1784631_1778011012_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260506/zhanbao_image_1784631_1778011012_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260506/zhanbao_image_1784631_1778011012_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>米林科维奇、曼达什破门；新月取得联赛4连胜+31轮不败，积77分位居第2名，距榜首利雅得胜利2分。</p><p><strong>【热门新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-06/69fa0d9239ea7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">冲击首冠！阿森纳队史第二次晋级欧冠决赛，上次是20年前</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/69fa0dba105d5_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/69fa0dba105d5_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/69fa0dba105d5_720.jpg"> </div><p>欧冠半决赛次回合，阿森纳1-0战胜马竞晋级决赛。阿森纳队史第二次晋级欧冠决赛，他们上一次进决赛是2005/06赛季，当时他们1-2不敌巴萨。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-06/69fa0afa4873anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">静待对手出炉！欧冠决赛：阿森纳vs巴黎/拜仁胜者！5月31日打响</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260506/202605060455029256_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260506/202605060455029256_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260506/202605060455029256_720.jpg"> </div><p>欧冠半决赛次回合对阵已经结束一场，欧冠决赛的首支队伍确认，阿森纳两回合击败马竞，时隔20年再战欧冠决赛！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-06/69fa565d1cd10native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">一段时代的终结！35岁格列兹曼或已经踢完了生涯最后一场欧冠比赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250321/67dca450b00ed.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250321/67dca450b00ed.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250321/67dca450b00ed.jpg"> </div><p>欧冠半决赛次回合，马竞不敌阿森纳被淘汰出局。本场比赛，35岁老将格列兹曼在下半场第67分钟被换下。随着马竞无缘决赛，此前就确定赛季末离队，将加盟美职联的格列兹曼或许已经踢完了生涯的最后一场欧冠比赛。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-06/69fa16412ece1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">能否不败夺冠？阿森纳本赛季欧冠仍不败，11胜3平、仅丢6球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/69fa0dba105d5_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/69fa0dba105d5_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260505/69fa0dba105d5_720.jpg"> </div><p>阿森纳本赛季欧冠仍保持不败，11胜3平，打进29球只丢了6球，其中联赛阶段8战全胜。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-06/69fa6a97e1b5fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">真有冲突？卡雷拉斯声明：一直以职业精神工作 与队友的事已解决</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.69" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260506/202605060609529666.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260506/202605060609529666.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260506/202605060609529666.jpg"> </div><p>西媒近日报道，卡雷拉斯此前与吕迪格发生冲突，被后者扇了一巴掌。TA还表示，卡雷拉斯的职业态度遭皇马教练组质疑。卡雷拉斯社媒发文回应。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-06/69fa178e4baf9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：波尔图已从阿森纳买断基维奥尔，费用1700万+500万浮动</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.4" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251010/68e7f69f992a7.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.4" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.4" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251010/68e7f69f992a7.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251010/68e7f69f992a7.jpg"> </div><p>波尔图官方消息，俱乐部已从阿森纳买断基维奥尔，买断固定费用为1700万欧元，另设最高500万欧元浮动条款。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-06/69fa3bfe636fcnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">才过了三个月！U17男足2月份曾7-0横扫印尼，如今0-1被绝杀</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260506/202605060251375397.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260506/202605060251375397_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260506/202605060251375397_720.jpg"> </div><p>U17亚洲杯